{"version":1,"content":"<p>大家樂集團旗艦社區食物援助計劃「大家開飯」今年踏入第五年。</p><p>集團宣布本年度將與基督教勵行會、食德好及聖雅各福群會合作，向基層家庭、長者及低收入人士合共派發 1,500 張面值 1,000 港元的「開飯咭」，預計可提供 30,000 份飯餐。</p><p>受</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T05:12:41.278354+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T05:00:09+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T05:06:06.043209+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T05:06:06.043209+00:00","content_hash":"2417581019e49141cc376cf5c0b2d4c78221d316c318129ca9ce947ec6fbc3e5","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}